# ===== 第三方依赖（不随仓库分发，见 third_party/README.md）=====
# 纳入跟踪的自研代码：
#   third_party/README.md
#   third_party/Funasr/Funasr_server.py + start_server.bat（需 git add -f）
#   third_party/Submit/（字幕插件）
#   third_party/Debug/（调试查看器；context/ 快照为运行时数据，不入库）
/third_party/*
!/third_party/Submit/
!/third_party/Debug/
/third_party/Debug/context/

